<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>In the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Level%20editor#Manage_exports" title="Level editor">Manage Exports</a> window for the level editor, the Render Lightmaps and Wait never completes and will remain in the Running state indefinitely even after the lightmapping is done.  For example the following render took 83 seconds (as you can see) but Render Lightmaps and Wait was still in the Running state some 25 minutes later.
</p>
<pre>
