<p>I suspect it is waiting for some notification back from your render farm to tell it the Lightmaps have rendered but that event isn't generated by the current version of EclipseRay which means this options is currently unusable and therefore, requires to be run as a separate task (via menu or toolbar) before the other tasks can be run (via the Manage Exports window).  This is a little annoying as you can't simply let the process run for a couple of hours but have to return periodically start the automated processes after the lightmap has been rendered.
</p>
<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Workarounds">Workarounds</span></h2>
<p>Pre-render lightmaps from using the options on the toolbar and toggle the Run? status for Render Lightmaps and Wait to No.
</p>
